+---
+"@gpuix/native": minor
+"@gpuix/solid": minor
+---
+
+Add explicit framework-neutral custom host-element registration and branded
+element names. Solid consumes the shared allowlist and checks an initialized
+macOS renderer's native factory registry before mounting custom tags. Schema
+registration does not load native code or seal native installation. Applications
+augment the existing Solid JSX intrinsic-elements interface for custom props.
